      "message": "You have integrated `std::expected` in the lower layers (`BootromComm`, `UsbComm`), but the upper layers in `et171_flash.cc` (e.g., `ProgramFlashPayload`, `RunFlashFw`, `RunFlashCmd`) revert to returning raw `int` (`0` or `-1`).\n\n**The Fix:** Push `std::expected` all the way up to `main()`. This prevents state confusion and standardizes how failures are caught and reported.",
